Lo siento.

17
00:04:01,407 --> 00:04:02,659
Mun Seo-ha.

18
00:04:05,536 --> 00:04:07,872
¿Por qué conservas esto?

19
00:04:36,317 --> 00:04:41,864
{\an8}¿SOY YO LA MARIPOSA,
O ES LA MARIPOSA MI SER?

20
00:04:53,459 --> 00:04:57,922
<i>KIMCHI</i> ESTOFADO DE AE-GYEONG

21
00:05:54,937 --> 00:05:55,772
